    "https://www.indeed.com/hire?co=US&hl=en": {
      "title": "Indeed for Employers",
      "description": "Indeed for employers – Home Features Resources Pricing Help Sign in Post a job For jobseekers Sign in Post a job Indeed for Employers Hiring that's simpler, faster, and more human Post a job Pause Video The people you’re looking for are here What job title are you hiring for? Where are you hiring? Search 46,920,142 job seekers in the US ​ 1 Find and connect with your candidates on our leading sourcing and engagement platform. Get started Everything you need for end-to-end hiring Elevate Elevate Accelerate Accelerate Streamline Streamline Attract quality candidates and build your brand Create a standout job post Posting or syncing your job is easy. With AI-generated job descriptions and Indeed Talent Scout , you can enhance your postings to reach top candidates. Maximize your job post results Tap into Indeed’s reach of 96% of US online job seekers. ​ 2 For better visibility, sponsor your job and, with a Premium plan, level up with matching, candidate targeting ​ 3 , branding, and more. Showcase your company Boost brand awareness and attract job seekers across Glassdoor, Indeed, and other popular sites with employer branding , leveraging insights to attract potential candidates. Start attracting talent​ ​ Make meaningful connections on one platform Instantly surface relevant profiles A Smart Sourcing subscription connects you to a deep pool of active job seekers, with millions of resumes added or updated monthly. Evaluate candidates with smarter screening Indeed Smart Screening screens and scores candidates against employers’ objective criteria, delivering rich candidate insights to your ATS so your team can evaluate applicants faster. Message and interview candidates all in one place After posting and sponsoring your jobs, you can manage candidates and contact matched profiles. Streamline and improve the entire process from job description to interview with time-saving AI features, including candidate summaries ​ 4 and auto-generated messages. Start connecting with candidates​ ​ Spend more time on what matters most Integrate your ATS Sync job and applicant data across your Applicant Tracking System (ATS) and Indeed. With ATS Sync, spend less time switching between systems and more time hiring. Indeed connects with 350+ ATS platforms globally. Insights to win top talent With Talent Scout , get market and job-specific insights on compensation, benefits, and more to stand out from the competition. Host a hiring event Indeed Hiring Events make it easy to schedule interviews and connect with candidates virtually or in person. Our all-in-one solution combines built-in talent attraction and automated interview scheduling to help you hire faster. Start streamlining the process ​ Flexible ways to get started Choose the hiring option that fits your goals, your budget, and your schedule so you can start finding candidates right away. Post today Try Indeed Set up a free Indeed employer account and make the most of your post with on-demand market and candidate data specific to your role and location. Regular job post visibility Appear in front of people looking for a job like yours. Get started for free Sponsor your job Reach skilled talent Connect with quality candidates faster with Standard and Premium Plans. Boosted job post visibility Get maximum visibility for specialized roles and expedite your hiring with a Premium Sponsored Job. Reach more top talent With Premium Sponsored Jobs, get additional targeting, branding, and matching. ​ 5 Sponsor a job Source candidates Match with the right talent, faster With Smart Sourcing, efficiently find and connect with quality candidates using AI-powered matching, screening, and messaging to fill open positions with the right talent. Find qualified candidates with the right skills Use AI-assisted highlights to help speed up screening or use powerful search tools to identify relevant candidates. Connect with candidates effectively Our matching technology ​ 6 analyzes candidates’ skills, preferences and resume against your requirements. On average, employers made a hire 40% faster when they invited matched candidates to apply. ​ 7 Get matches through chat Receive a list of candidates through a simple conversation when you add in the power of Talent Scout. Start a trial Used by more than 3.5+ million companies globally Featured Small Business Education Healthcare Hospitality Staffing Technology 23,499 Jobs currently posted View all Burger King job posts ​ \"Indeed is delivering 5x as many qualified candidates as job boards for 10% of the cost.\" Jack Boyce Director Global Staffing Solutions, Welch Allyn Read case study ​ 31 Hires in 12 months, including hard-to-fill positions Read case study ​ 40+ New hires across 15 locations Read case study ​ \"Having Indeed as one platform where it was all organized saved me a lot of time.\" Cami Justice Director of HR, Blue Star Donuts Read case study ​ 4 Jobs currently posted See all Zingerman’s jobs​ ​ 31 Hires in 12 months, including hard-to-fill positions Read case study ​ \"We cannot live without Indeed.\" Kathlene Collins Publisher, Inside Higher Ed 49 Jobs currently posted See Kumon jobs ​ 90 Employees hired through Indeed since 2022 Read case study ​ \"When I look at our costs on Indeed, $10 per application and $500 per hard-to-fill hire are unbelievable.\" Erin Hardwick Employment Coordinator, Tuality Healthcare Read case study ​ \"Indeed is delivering 5x as many qualified candidates as job boards for 10% of the cost.\" Jack Boyce Director Global Staffing Solutions, Welch Allyn Read case study ​ 113 Hires over a five-month period for a variety of roles and skill levels Read case study ​ +2,660% Sponsoring jobs on Indeed increased traffic to hard-to-fill roles by 2,660% 189 Jobs currently posted See all Lettuce Entertain You jobs​ ​ \"It’s our best source of applicants and hires.\" Keith Royal Vice President of Staffing, ECI Healthcare Read case study ​ 184 Jobs currently posted See all Spherion jobs ​ 400% Increase in traffic from Indeed after sponsoring jobs 657 Jobs currently posted See all Microsoft jobs​ ​ \"Indeed definitely has helped bring down our average cost per hire.\" Lisa Hart Talent Acquisition Manager, Nokia 280 Jobs currently posted See all Cisco jobs ​ Resources for every step of the journey How-to guides Employer Guide Find guidance ​ Thought leadership Indeed Insights Be inspired ​ Economic data and analysis Hiring Lab Gain understanding ​ Frequently Asked Questions How do I create an Indeed for Employers account for free? Click “Post a job” or “Get started” to begin. Account registration is free and provides immediate access to your Employer Dashboard to manage your hiring. Does Indeed integrate with my ATS? Yes, Indeed integrates with hundreds of leading applicant tracking systems (ATS). If you don’t use an ATS, our platform includes free applicant tracking tools to manage candidates and schedule interviews. How can I contact candidates who haven't applied to my job? You can use Indeed Smart Sourcing to search millions of resumes in our database. When you find a qualified match, you can proactively invite them to apply for your role. How does Indeed help me screen candidates? You can add Screener Questions to your job post to filter for “must-have” qualifications. Additionally, you can use Indeed Interview to conduct live virtual interviews directly on the platform. Can Indeed help with high-volume hiring? Yes. Indeed offers solutions for large-scale needs, including the ability to sponsor multiple roles, programmatic options and Featured Employer status for maximum brand exposure. What are the benefits of a Sponsored Job? Sponsored Jobs stay prominent in search results and are featured in relevant job alerts. They also unlock features like Instant Match and “Urgently Hiring” tags. Can sponsoring improve time-to-hire? Yes. Sponsored Jobs posted directly on Indeed with the Urgently Hiring tag receive 74% more applications than Sponsored Jobs without it. ​ 8 How can I improve visibility? Sponsoring is the most effective way. Also, ensure your job title is standard and your location (including zip code) is precise. How do I attract top talent? Provide clear salary ranges, detailed descriptions and unique benefits. Transparency helps attract quality applicants quickly. How can Indeed help with Employer Branding? You can claim your Company Page to showcase reviews and culture. Premium options allow for videos, custom branding and Featured Employer logos. How much does it cost to sponsor? You set a daily or monthly budget and only pay when candidates engage with your post. Can I post without listing the salary? Generally yes, unless state laws require it. However, jobs with salary and other information receive 49% more started applications. ​ 9 How long until my job is visible? Most posts are reviewed and go live within 24–48 hours. Why is my job here if I didn’t post it? Indeed aggregates listings from across the web to provide job seekers with a comprehensive search experience. How do I manage/cancel my post? Use the “Jobs” tab in your dashboard to edit details or change the status to “Paused” or “Closed.” Does Indeed remove job postings? Yes, if they violate quality standards, such as misleading titles or discriminatory language. How is Indeed different from other places where I can post jobs? Indeed is both a job search engine and an all-in-one hiring platform. Beyond jobs posted directly by employers, Indeed also aggregates job listings from thousands of sources across the internet. Employers can post jobs directly on Indeed for additional features, including Screener Questions, virtual interviews and access to Hiring Insights. We're here to help Visit our Help Center for answers to common questions or contact us directly. Help center Contact support Indeed About Indeed Press Security Terms Privacy Center and Ad Choices Accessibility at Indeed Work at Indeed Countries Sitemap Employers Post a job Source candidates Products Pricing Indeed Insights Public Sector ATS Integrations FAQ Resources Employer guide How to hire employees How to write job descriptions Guide to hiring with Indeed Interview questions guide Hiring Lab Indeed Events Product updates © 2026 • Indeed Your privacy choices Post a Job | Indeed for Employers Edit"
