r letter with samples and tips to help you write an effective one. 10 Best Skills To Put on a Resume (With Examples) In this article, we explore 10 of the best skills to list on a resume, examples of skill sets across different roles and answers to common questions. Featured articles AI Prompts for Resumes: 4 Templates and Examples for Job Seekers What Words Does AI Look For in a Resume? (How Automated Screening Works) Patient Services Representative Skills Packager Skills How To Write a Resume Summary as a Student See more articles about resumes & cover letters Interviewing Common questions, answers and advice to help you prepare Top Interview Questions and Answers (With 25+ Examples and Tips) Prepare for common interview questions by reviewing example answers, using the STAR method for situational queries and highlighting your unique experience. Interview Question: \"Tell Me About Yourself\" (With Answers) Answer “Tell me about yourself” in an interview by highlighting recent accomplishments, connecting past experience to the role and using a clear formula. A Helpful List of Example Weaknesses for Interviewing In this article, we explore why interviewers ask about your weaknesses, provide a list of responses and show you how to frame your answers positively. Explore more articles Interview Questions and Answers for an Industrial Electrician Corporate Banking Interview Questions (With Examples) Curator Interview Questions (With Examples) Interview Questions and Answers for a Mechanical Assembler Interview Questions and Answers for a Diesel Technician See more articles about interviewing Pay & salary Data and tips for talking about money at work How To Negotiate Salary After a Job Offer (With 13 Tips) Learn how to negotiate your salary after a job offer to ensure you're fairly compensated and increase your earning potential throughout your career. 25 Work-From-Home Jobs That Pay Well (With Tips and FAQ) Discover 25 work-from-home jobs that pay well in a variety of industries, learn about their average salary and duties and get tips on how to find them. How To Ask for a Raise (A Guide With Script Examples) Learn how to ask for a raise, including when and how much to ask for, then review an example script to help you advocate for yourself. Featured articles A Definitive Guide to E-7 Pay (And How To Become Eligible) How Much Does a Fellow Make? With Average Salary and Tips A Guide for Mechanics Who Want To Earn 6 Figures How Much Does an NFL Trainer Make (and Other Salary Questions) How Much Does Someone With a Six Sigma Yellow Belt Make? See more articles about pay & salary Career development Skills and steps to take your career to the next level How To Write a Proposal Letter (With Template and Example) In this Indeed Career Coach-approved article, you will learn how to write a compelling proposal letter and structure it properly. 10 In-Demand Career Certifications (And How To Achieve Them) Learn about 10 types of in-demand certifications when considering a career and how you can obtain one of these certifications. Self-Introductions With Tips and Examples Learn how to craft a powerful self-introduction with these tips and essential details that will help you make a lasting impression, along with some examples. Featured articles 8 Free Online AI Courses for Professional Skill Development How to Become an AI Trainer How to Work With AI in Your Career Exploring Management Principles (With Examples) Career Change Ideas for a Therapist See more articles about career development Starting a new job Best practices to make a strong impression and transition smoothly How To Create a 30-60-90-Day Plan for a New Job In this article, we discuss what a 30-60-90-day plan is and how to write one, plus provide tips and answer FAQs to help support your success in a new job. How To Introduce Yourself at Work (With Tips and Examples) Learn how to introduce yourself to colleagues in the workplace and explore examples and tips to build solid work r