n engaging Manager Assistant resume using Indeed's library of free resume examples and templates. Customized samples based on the most contacted Manager Assistant resumes from over 100 million resumes on file. In an Uncertain Job Market, Remote Workers are Testing Each Other's Patience As more people turn to remote work, third spaces become increasingly important as essential infrastructure for many seeking productivity and community. And just like in an actual office, the come with a whole set of etiquette challenges. How Surah Caver Found Better Work: \"I didn't think it was really possible for me to be happy in a role\" Indeed sits down with Surah Caver to discuss how she left her job in tech sales to find Better Work as a child behavioral analyst. Disrupting Education: Gen AI's Role in Shaping Tomorrow's Workforce Explore how Generative AI is reshaping education and its possible impact on the future workforce. Learn about the revolution in learning and reskilling for tomorrow. 12 Tips for a Successful First Day at Work Learn why the first day of your new job is so important and explore tips to help you have a successful start to your new position. 3 Example Termination Letters (With Template) Learn about the importance and use of termination letters and how to write one with examples. How to Write a Welcome Message to a New Employee It's important to welcome new employees in a manner that’s informative and reassuring. In this article, we explain how to write a positive welcome message to a new employee. Browse Articles Hiring Lab Career advice Browse jobs Browse companies Salaries Indeed Events Work at Indeed Countries About Help ESG at Indeed © 2026 Indeed Your Privacy Choices Accessibility at Indeed Privacy Center and Ad Choices Terms"
